     },
     "value": "Medicine packs must carry a varenummer that identifies each individual pack; the marketing authorisation holder or its representative requests it. On human medicine outer labelling the Nordic number is required (with listed exemptions) and may be written 'Vnr XX XX XX'; a bar code is accepted but not required."
